Description: A documentation hub for the 'chef' ecosystem of R packages for
    clinical trial evidence generation following AMNOG
    (Arzneimittelmarktneuordnungsgesetz) guidelines. Provides vignettes
    covering endpoint specification, statistical methods, criteria functions,
    and result data models used in healthcare technology assessments. The core
    functionality is provided by the companion packages 'chef', 'chefStats',
    and 'chefCriteria'.
